mson Dragon. Jaden informs Yusei of Paradox's true intentions. By stealing various monsters from across time and turning them dark, he plans to kill Maximillion Pegasus, the creator of Duel Monsters, preventing the game from being created and causing the events of all three series to never happen. Yusei and Jaden agree to pursue Paradox, which leads them to the past and causes a meeting with the King of Games, Yugi Mutou. However, by the time Yusei & Jaden arrive, Paradox had already attacked his time, supposedly killing both Pegasus and Yugi's grandpa, and had also managed to steal Blue-Eyes White Dragon and Red-Eyes Black Dragon. After explaining everything to Yugi, he agrees to fight with Yusei and Jaden against Paradox in the ultimate three-on-one duel to free the trapped monsters and save both the world and time itself before it's too late.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia)"},"tags":[{"name":"Crossover","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Card Battle","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cyberpunk","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":73,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shounen","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Motorcycles","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Yu-Gi-Oh! 3D: Bonds Beyond Time","english":"Yu-Gi-Oh! 3D: Bonds Beyond Time","native":"劇場版 遊☆戯☆王 ～超融合! 時空を越えた絆～","romaji":"Yu☆Gi☆Oh!: Chou Yuugou! Toki wo Koeta Kizuna","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"10thアニバーサリー 劇場版 遊☆戯☆王 〜超融合!時空を越えた絆〜"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"游戏王剧场版 超融合！超越时空的羁绊"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"10th周年剧场版 游戏王 ～超融合！跨越时空的羁绊～"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Yu-Gi-Oh! Bonds Beyond Time"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}